# riscv-arch-test (ACT4) corpus for the P3.4 lockstep harness. One ELF
# path per line, repo-root-relative. #-comments and blank lines ignored.
# Regenerate with:
#   find verification/riscv-arch-test/work/quantiumv-rv64im/elfs/ -name '*.elf' | grep -v /Zicntr | sort
# The Zicntr tests are left out: they read cycle, which counts clocks, so the two cores read different
# values. ACT runs them on both cores.
